@WS_CON_UNI_DOTNET_REST_HostAddress = http://localhost:5111
@token = pega-aqui-el-token-devuelto-por-autenticar

### Autenticar
POST {{WS_CON_UNI_DOTNET_REST_HostAddress}}/api/ws-con-uni/autenticar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "monster",
  "clave": "monster123"
}

### Recuperar clave
POST {{WS_CON_UNI_DOTNET_REST_HostAddress}}/api/ws-con-uni/recuperar-clave
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "monster",
  "nuevaClave": "monster123"
}

### Obtener categorías
GET {{WS_CON_UNI_DOTNET_REST_HostAddress}}/api/ws-con-uni/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener unidades
GET {{WS_CON_UNI_DOTNET_REST_HostAddress}}/api/ws-con-uni/unidades?categoria=LONGITUD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Convertir
POST {{WS_CON_UNI_DOTNET_REST_HostAddress}}/api/ws-con-uni/convertir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoria": "LONGITUD",
  "unidadOrigen": "METRO",
  "unidadDestino": "CENTIMETRO",
  "valor": 2
}
